WEBVTT

00:45:59.850 --> 00:46:02.596
CA: Well, Susan, I feel very lucky
to have got to sit down

00:46:02.620 --> 00:46:05.439
and talk for so long with a revolutionary.

00:46:05.463 --> 00:46:06.948
Thank you for what you've done.

00:46:06.972 --> 00:46:11.886
You've really changed how literally
millions of people see themselves,

00:46:11.910 --> 00:46:13.979
and this has been an absolute delight.

00:46:14.003 --> 00:46:17.408
SC: Well, thank you so much
for having me on that stage and now here.

00:46:17.432 --> 00:46:18.935
It's so nice to be with you.

00:46:18.959 --> 00:46:20.882
CA: Thank you, Susan. SC: Thank you.

00:46:20.906 --> 00:46:26.572
(Music)

00:46:28.623 --> 00:46:31.054
CA: Susan Cain is the author of